  "description": "Opens on a main that two sessions are now writing to. PR #163, a design system and a rebuilt file browser, merged from elsewhere while run/0019's last item was in CI, and the collision was not theoretical: it moved the Settings entry out of the navbar into the account dropdown, so resolving the conflict by taking main's side wholesale would have silently dropped item/admin-users's own fix and the PR would still have looked correct. Recorded in decision/0047. tests and assertions are -1 rather than copied from run/0019, per decision/0044: a number carried forward reads as a measurement. item/ledger-field-audit decides whether -1 gains that meaning formally.",
